\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {RQ2 demonstration: a real CTF-Dojo evolution cycle} (provenance: logged cycle, \texttt  {branch/binary-reversing}). Five panels left-to-right: (1) Analyst reads failing-batch trajectories and writes a new failure regime entry to \texttt  {task\_board.md}; (2) three parallel Researchers explore disjoint hypotheses in isolation and append \texttt  {works:true/false} rows to \texttt  {research\_log.jsonl}; (3) Builder reads only the \texttt  {works:true} records, writes \texttt  {infra/binary\_analysis.py}, and updates \texttt  {architecture.md}; (4) Verifier executes the new pipeline against held-out tasks and reports pass/fail; (5) the originally-failing task is re-solved on the next batch using the routed pipeline. Persistent state files (highlighted) link the phases.\relax }}{10}{figure.caption.10}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:rq2_demo}{{4}{10}{\textbf {RQ2 demonstration: a real CTF-Dojo evolution cycle} (provenance: logged cycle, \texttt {branch/binary-reversing}). Five panels left-to-right: (1) Analyst reads failing-batch trajectories and writes a new failure regime entry to \texttt {task\_board.md}; (2) three parallel Researchers explore disjoint hypotheses in isolation and append \texttt {works:true/false} rows to \texttt {research\_log.jsonl}; (3) Builder reads only the \texttt {works:true} records, writes \texttt {infra/binary\_analysis.py}, and updates \texttt {architecture.md}; (4) Verifier executes the new pipeline against held-out tasks and reports pass/fail; (5) the originally-failing task is re-solved on the next batch using the routed pipeline. Persistent state files (highlighted) link the phases.\relax }{figure.caption.10}{}}
